abstract = {A new measurement of the ratio of the CP-violating amplitudes for KL → 2π0 and KL → π+π− is reported. The measured value for R = ∣η00/η+-∣2 is 0.9878±0.0026±0.0030, where the first error is the statistical uncertainty and the second is the estimate of the systematic uncertainty. This gives a value for the parameter describing direct CP violation: Re ϵ'/ϵ = (2.0 ± 0.7) × 10−3.}
}

